      "text": "Testing, testing."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 4.22,
      "end": 4.64,
      "timestamp": "0:04",
      "range": "0:04 - 0:04",
      "text": "Okay,"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 5.66,
      "end": 7.54,
      "timestamp": "0:05",
      "range": "0:05 - 0:07",
      "text": "we're all done with this project."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 7.78,
      "end": 13.48,
      "timestamp": "0:07",
      "range": "0:07 - 0:13",
      "text": "And so I'm starting out with the main bathroom to show you first because the master bathroom"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 13.56,
      "end": 13.72,
      "timestamp": "0:13",
      "range": "0:13 - 0:13",
      "text": "is"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 14.92,
      "end": 15.68,
      "timestamp": "0:14",
      "range": "0:14 - 0:15",
      "text": "so amazing."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 16.42,
      "end": 17.8,
      "timestamp": "0:16",
      "range": "0:16 - 0:17",
      "text": "But so is this bathroom too."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 18.32,
      "end": 20.32,
      "timestamp": "0:18",
      "range": "0:18 - 0:20",
      "text": "Check out the tile work that we did in here."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 21.1,
      "end": 23.32,
      "timestamp": "0:21",
      "range": "0:21 - 0:23",
      "text": "I love the tile that my clients picked out."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 23.88,
      "end": 26.22,
      "timestamp": "0:23",
      "range": "0:23 - 0:26",
      "text": "And then you gotta get a good look at this niche right here."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 27.72,
      "end": 28.56,
      "timestamp": "0:27",
      "range": "0:27 - 0:28",
      "text": "Isn't that cool?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 28.94,
      "end": 32.42,
      "timestamp": "0:28",
      "range": "0:28 - 0:32",
      "text": "And then we got the LED light in there, both sections."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 33.24,
      "end": 33.98,
      "timestamp": "0:33",
      "range": "0:33 - 0:33",
      "text": "And then of course,"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 34.9,
      "end": 36.0,
      "timestamp": "0:34",
      "range": "0:34 - 0:36",
      "text": "we have our new window."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 38.22,
      "end": 38.94,
      "timestamp": "0:38",
      "range": "0:38 - 0:38",
      "text": "That look awesome?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 40.42,
      "end": 42.78,
      "timestamp": "0:40",
      "range": "0:40 - 0:42",
      "text": "And then I wanted to show you in here"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 43.7,
      "end": 47.32,
      "timestamp": "0:43",
      "range": "0:43 - 0:47",
      "text": "that this is the closet that we had to remodel to get rid of"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 48.04,
      "end": 49.72,
      "timestamp": "0:48",
      "range": "0:48 - 0:49",
      "text": "the angle that was in the shower."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 50.48,
      "end": 52.56,
      "timestamp": "0:50",
      "range": "0:50 - 0:52",
      "text": "And so look down here, see this doorknob right here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 54.1,
      "end": 56.24,
      "timestamp": "0:54",
      "range": "0:54 - 0:56",
      "text": "We put this flat doorknob on so you can"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 57.48,
      "end": 58.46,
      "timestamp": "0:57",
      "range": "0:57 - 0:58",
      "text": "turn it like that"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 59.96,
      "end": 62.98,
      "timestamp": "0:59",
      "range": "0:59 - 1:02",
      "text": "because if the bedroom door or the bathroom door,"
